  "description": "Beneath the scary headlines, several indicators are telling a very different story. Let’s look at the evidence...",
  "body_html": "<p>Last week was chaotic in the stock market. But when we step back, putting our personal economic experiences to the side and look at the big picture holistically, was it really that bad? Not really…</p><p>The stock market has been trending upwards despite all of the wars, Ukraine and Iran. Yes, some short term volatility, but <em><strong>trend remains upwards. </strong></em></p><p>Sure, AI-driven tech sell offs have occurred, but we are seeing resilience in several sectors such as Finance, Health care and other “recession resistant” assets. If anything, its probably a good thing that companies like Intel, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$INTC&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Google, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$GOOG&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Meta, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$META&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> have bene brought back to reality. </p><p>One headline reads: “NASDAQ and S&amp;P 500 suffer worst day and month since June 2025.” Pretty scary headline… but glancing over at the S&amp;P 500, and it is just consolidating around, in the same range it has since August. Nothing exciting, but nothing bad either. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png\" width=\"1429\" height=\"861\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:861,&quot;width&quot;:1429,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:295109,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/223172045?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3j_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F88b5f446-025a-454b-b4d8-720144e8fe87_1429x861.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Big headline. Little price action. </figcaption></figure></div><p>If anything, I would say the stock market has been incredibly resilient. Last week, I shared the image below. Middle East escalation, bond yields rising, weak manufacturing, a rate hike, hot inflation and China’s AI bubble popping: None of them could really drop the stock market. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png\" width=\"1429\" height=\"867\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:867,&quot;width&quot;:1429,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!utmF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85490bf6-5cda-412e-b517-f61fdf18198c_1429x867.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=